#: lib/tuist_web/controllers/auth_controller.ex:841
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your organization hasn't verified a login email domain that matches your email, so single sign-on can't create a Tuist account for you. If you were invited, sign up with the invited email address, accept the invitation, and then sign in with single sign-on to link your account."
